<title>DENMARK: Brewer Carlsberg H1 1996/97 profit rises.</title>
<headline>Brewer Carlsberg H1 1996/97 profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to March 31 1997</p>
<p>					  (million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Group pre-tax result		  870  vs  741</p>
<p> Group net turnover		   9,214 vs  8,537</p>
<p> Group operating result		 532 vs  530</p>
<p> Net financial items		   338 vs  211</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Danish brewery group is Carlsberg A/S. It said in a statement that it expected a full year 1996/97 operating result in the region of 1995/96's 1.252 billion crowns. The result was better than analysts' expectations of an average first-half 1996/97 pre-tax profit of 812 million crowns.</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45-33-969652</p>
</text>
